{"title":"都是普通劳动者(新风俗画)","authors":[],"dates":[{"year":1976,"month":8,"day":29}],"is_range_date":false,"parts":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"蔡振华"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蔡振华"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"“同志!你是这里的赤脚医生小李吗?”"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"“小李在那边，我是县里医院来的!”"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"“请问到县委还有多少路?”"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"“县委书记老王在田头呢，可到那边去找他。”"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"“你们宣传队演得真好!”"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"“不!他们是革命样板戏剧组同志，来参加劳动的!”"}],"comments":[],"origin":"","comment_pivots":[],"description":"","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"alias":""}